\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Main results on Qwen3-8B (branching mix, trunk warm). \emph  {GSM8K} ($k{=}16$, $n{=}16$, $D{=}512$): ``Reject-only'' rejects $s_i{<}0.15$ and admits the rest; ``Blanket'' rejects $s_i{<}0.45$. Prefill $W$ is identical across hosts because hosts act after prefill. \emph  {MATH-500} ($k{=}16$, $n{=}32$, $D{=}1024$, no host): ``Probe'' uses $(\tau _{\mathrm  {pre}},\tau _{\mathrm  {dec}},t_0)=(0.15,0.45,128)$; its $W$ includes $W^{\mathrm  {ext}}$ from evicted probe pages. The MATH-500 committed residual is fixed to index $0$, so committed accuracy is insensitive to admission by construction and coverage is the informative metric.}}{7}{table.caption.10}\protected@file@percent }
