\newlabel{fig:pool}{{4}{13}{\textbf {Context-tree page pool} (pruning-aware KV state). \texttt {fork} aliases the trunk in $O(1)$ and allocates only residual pages~\textcircled {1}--\textcircled {3}. LCP commit publishes full blocks of $x_\star $ into $H$ so later steps can take \Hit on $\Din $~\textcircled {4}\textcircled {6}. \texttt {abort} returns residual pages only; the live occupancy is $M_{\mathrm {spine}}{=}b(L{+}\ell _\star )$~\textcircled {5}\textcircled {7}}{figure.caption.27}{}}
